---
// Kitty Cafe by X-Arts 的隱私權政策。
//
// ⚠️ 跟 privacy.astro 是**兩份不同的政策**,不要合併:
// privacy.astro 是 CatInsight Stock 的(沒有廣告、但有後端伺服器),
// 這一份是 Kitty Cafe 的(沒有後端、但有 AdMob 廣告)。
// 兩個 App 蒐集的東西幾乎完全不重疊,共用一份會兩邊都寫錯。
import SubpageLayout from '../layouts/SubpageLayout.astro';
---
<SubpageLayout title="Privacy Policy - Kitty Cafe by X-Arts" current="privacy">
  <div class="wrap"><div class="legal card">
    <h1>Privacy <span class="grad">Policy</span></h1>
    <div class="upd">Last updated: August 2026 · Kitty Cafe by X-Arts</div>

    <p>X-Arts Corporation LTD ("we", "us") built <b>Kitty Cafe by X-Arts</b> as a free game. This page explains what information the app handles and how. It applies only to Kitty Cafe by X-Arts; our other apps have their own policies.</p>

    <h2>No Account, No Sign-In</h2>
    <p>Kitty Cafe does not require you to create an account. We do not ask for or collect your name, email address, phone number, contacts, photos, or any other directly identifying personal information. We do not operate a game server, and we do not receive your game data.</p>

    <h2>Information Stored on Your Device</h2>
    <p>Your progress — which shifts you have unlocked, your star ratings, your language and sound settings, and which tutorials you have seen — is stored locally on your device. It stays there. Deleting the app deletes it.</p>

    <h2>Advertising</h2>
    <p>The game shows <b>opt-in rewarded video ads</b>. You are never shown an ad unless you tap a button asking for one (for example, to add extra time at the end of a shift). Ads are delivered by <b>Google AdMob</b>.</p>
    <p>To select and measure ads, Google AdMob may collect and process:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><b>Your device's advertising identifier (IDFA)</b> — only if you allow tracking when iOS asks. If you decline, you still get ads, but they are not personalised.</li>
      <li><b>Device and app information</b> — device model, operating system version, app version, language, and similar technical details.</li>
      <li><b>Approximate location derived from your IP address</b> — used for regional ad selection. We do not request or receive precise GPS location.</li>
      <li><b>Ad interaction data</b> — whether an ad was shown, viewed to completion, or tapped.</li>
      <li><b>Diagnostics</b> — crash and performance data.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>This information is handled by Google under its own privacy policy, not by us. We do not receive it, and we do not sell or share your personal data for any other purpose. See <a class="link" href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" target="_blank" rel="noopener">how Google uses information from apps that use its services</a> and the <a class="link" href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google Privacy Policy</a>.</p>

    <h2>Your Choices</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><b>Tracking</b> — you can change your answer to the tracking request at any time in <b>Settings › Privacy &amp; Security › Tracking</b> on your device.</li>
      <li><b>Personalised ads</b> — if you are in the EEA, the UK, or Switzerland, the game shows a consent form the first time you play. You can change or withdraw your choices there.</li>
      <li><b>Ads entirely</b> — rewarded ads are optional. Simply never tap the ad button and no ad will ever load.</li>
      <li><b>Your local data</b> — delete the app to remove all stored progress.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Children's Privacy</h2>
    <p>Kitty Cafe is rated 4+ for content, but it is <b>not directed to children</b> and is not part of the App Store Kids Category. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 13. If you believe a child has provided us with personal information, contact us and we will delete it.</p>

    <h2>Data Retention</h2>
    <p>We do not hold your data, so there is nothing for us to retain. Progress stored on your device remains until you delete it or uninstall the app. Data processed by Google AdMob is retained according to Google's own policies.</p>

    <h2>Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2>
    <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Material changes will be reflected by the "Last updated" date above. You are advised to review this page periodically.</p>

    <h2>Contact Us</h2>
    <p>If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, contact us at <a class="mail" href="mailto:contact@xarts.games">contact@xarts.games</a>.</p>
  </div></div>
</SubpageLayout>
